{"id":"n5-086","title":"だいたい〜","romaji":"daitai〜","jlptLevel":5,"shortExplanation":"Expresses 'roughly', 'approximately', or 'almost'.","longExplanation":"The だいたい〜 (daitai〜) grammar point is used to express a rough estimate or generalization, meaning 'roughly', 'approximately', or 'almost' in English. It can be used before numbers, amounts, or percentages to show that the value is not exact.","formation":"だいたい + Number/Amount/Percentage","examples":[{"jp":"だいたい１００人がパーティーに参加しました。","romaji":"Daitai hyaku-nin ga paatii ni sanka shimashita.","en":"Approximately 100 people attended the party.","words":[{"surface":"だいたい","vocabId":null},{"surface":"１","vocabId":null},{"surface":"０","vocabId":null},{"surface":"０","vocabId":null},{"surface":"人","vocabId":"1580640","reading":"にん"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"パーティー","vocabId":null},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"参加","vocabId":"1302090","reading":"さんか"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[0]},{"jp":"彼女はだいたい２時間でその仕事を終えます。","romaji":"Kanojo wa daitai ni-jikan de sono shigoto o oemasu.","en":"She finishes that work in roughly two hours.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"だいたい","vocabId":null},{"surface":"２","vocabId":null},{"surface":"時間","vocabId":"1315920","reading":"じかん"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"その","vocabId":null},{"surface":"仕事","vocabId":"1304970","reading":"しごと"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"終えます","vocabId":"1332760","reading":"おえます","baseForm":"終える"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[2]},{"jp":"だいたい８０％の生徒が試験に合格しました。","romaji":"Daitai hachijuu-paasento no seito ga shiken ni goukaku shimashita.","en":"About 80% of the students passed the exam.","words":[{"surface":"だいたい","vocabId":null},{"surface":"８","vocabId":null},{"surface":"０",